/-!
# A387758

Lexicographically earliest infinite sequence of distinct positive numbers such that, for n > 2, a(n) shares a factor with a(n-1) and is coprime to a(n-2) if a(n-1) > a(n-2), else it is coprime to a(n-1) and shares a factor with a(n-2) if a(n-1) < a(n-2).

The 65 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

